{"id":"01d522a0b0df3738","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation.md","title":"Lachlan 阶段记号与有界 oracle 计算","display":"df-oracle-stage-evaluation — Lachlan 阶段记号与有界 oracle 计算","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation","aliases":["20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation"],"display":"df-oracle-stage-evaluation — Lachlan 阶段记号与有界 oracle 计算","chapter":"3","section":"3.3.5","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"definition-checked","source_reference":"Definition 3.3.10","source_printed_pages":[57],"source_pdf_pages":[93],"depends_on":["[[20-df-oracle-numbering]]","[[20-df-use]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-oracle-stage-evaluation — Lachlan 阶段记号与有界 oracle 计算"},{"key":"chapter","html":"3"},{"key":"section","html":"3.3.5"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-checked"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Definition 3.3.10"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"140cce30ee9c16d1\" href=\"?note=140cce30ee9c16d1\" title=\"20-df-oracle-numbering\">20-df-oracle-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4b1f1864d7fb1f2e\" href=\"?note=4b1f1864d7fb1f2e\" title=\"20-df-use\">20-df-use</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,e\\in\\omega\">\\(s,e\\in\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_s\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(A_s\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span> 是阶段 oracle；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x_s\\in\\omega\">\\(x_s\\in\\omega\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"140cce30ee9c16d1\" href=\"?note=140cce30ee9c16d1\" title=\"20-df-oracle-numbering\">20-df-oracle-numbering</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4b1f1864d7fb1f2e\" href=\"?note=4b1f1864d7fb1f2e\" title=\"20-df-use\">20-df-use</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Hist}(e,B,z,y,c)\">\\(\\operatorname{Hist}(e,B,z,y,c)\\)</span> 是 oracle-numbering 的有限停止配置历史；历史有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|c|-1\">\\(|c|-1\\)</span> 次转移。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(B\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z,y\\in\\omega\">\\(z,y\\in\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A_s)_{s\\in\\omega}\">\\((A_s)_{s\\in\\omega}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(x_s)_{s\\in\\omega}\">\\((x_s)_{s\\in\\omega}\\)</span> 是固定的阶段参数序列，常量输入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x_s=x\">\\(x_s=x\\)</span>。对任意固定 oracle <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span>，有界模拟是相对于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 的有限运算；只有 oracle 答案也可有效取得时才是普通可判定关系。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}oracle-stage-evaluation}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\Phi_e^A(x)[s]\\simeq\\Phi_{e,s}^{A_s}(x_s),\\\\\n\\Phi_{e,s}^{B}(z)\\downarrow=y\\Longleftrightarrow e,z,y&lt;s\\land\n\\exists c\\ [\\operatorname{Hist}(e,B,z,y,c)\\land |c|-1&lt;s\\land u_e^B(z)&lt;s].\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}oracle-stage-evaluation}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\Phi_e^A(x)[s]\\simeq\\Phi_{e,s}^{A_s}(x_s),\\\\\n\\Phi_{e,s}^{B}(z)\\downarrow=y\\Longleftrightarrow e,z,y&lt;s\\land\n\\exists c\\ [\\operatorname{Hist}(e,B,z,y,c)\\land |c|-1&lt;s\\land u_e^B(z)&lt;s].\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{gathered}\n\\Phi_{e,s}^{\\sigma}(x)\\downarrow=y\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\ne,x,y&lt;s\\land\\exists c\\ [\\operatorname{Hist}(e,A_\\sigma,x,y,c)\\land |c|-1&lt;s\\\\\n\\land\\forall i&lt;|c|\\ (q_i\\in Q_{e,q}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{num}(t_i,h_i)&lt;|\\sigma|)\n\\land u_e^\\sigma(x)&lt;s]\\quad(\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}),\\\\\n\\Phi_{e,s}^{X}(x)\\simeq\\Phi_{e,s}^{\\operatorname{set}(X)}(x)\\quad(X\\in2^\\omega).\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{gathered}\n\\Phi_{e,s}^{\\sigma}(x)\\downarrow=y\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\ne,x,y&lt;s\\land\\exists c\\ [\\operatorname{Hist}(e,A_\\sigma,x,y,c)\\land |c|-1&lt;s\\\\\n\\land\\forall i&lt;|c|\\ (q_i\\in Q_{e,q}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{num}(t_i,h_i)&lt;|\\sigma|)\n\\land u_e^\\sigma(x)&lt;s]\\quad(\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}),\\\\\n\\Phi_{e,s}^{X}(x)\\simeq\\Phi_{e,s}^{\\operatorname{set}(X)}(x)\\quad(X\\in2^\\omega).\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>方括号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[s]\">\\([s]\\)</span> 同时替换表达式中各阶段参数；固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span> 的模拟相对于所给 oracle 可判定，只有所需 oracle 答案可有效取得时才可作普通有效判定。该有界约定与本目录非相对阶段模拟兼容，改变最终时限不改变停止关系。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_s\">\\(A_s\\)</span> 随阶段改变时，早期停止不保证以后保留；必须另核对实际 use 以内的 oracle 位。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 3.3.10；印刷页 57；PDF 第 93 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-oracle-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"140cce30ee9c16d1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-oracle-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-use","status":"resolved","id":"4b1f1864d7fb1f2e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-use]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-oracle-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"140cce30ee9c16d1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-oracle-numbering]]；see [[20-df-use]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-use","status":"resolved","id":"4b1f1864d7fb1f2e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-oracle-numbering]]；see [[20-df-use]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"s,e\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"A_s\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"x_s\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Hist}(e,B,z,y,c)","display":false},{"tex":"|c|-1","display":false},{"tex":"B\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"z,y\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"(A_s)_{s\\in\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"(x_s)_{s\\in\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"x_s=x","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}oracle-stage-evaluation}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\Phi_e^A(x)[s]\\simeq\\Phi_{e,s}^{A_s}(x_s),\\\\\n\\Phi_{e,s}^{B}(z)\\downarrow=y\\Longleftrightarrow e,z,y<s\\land\n\\exists c\\ [\\operatorname{Hist}(e,B,z,y,c)\\land |c|-1<s\\land u_e^B(z)<s].\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{gathered}\n\\Phi_{e,s}^{\\sigma}(x)\\downarrow=y\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\ne,x,y<s\\land\\exists c\\ [\\operatorname{Hist}(e,A_\\sigma,x,y,c)\\land |c|-1<s\\\\\n\\land\\forall i<|c|\\ (q_i\\in Q_{e,q}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{num}(t_i,h_i)<|\\sigma|)\n\\land u_e^\\sigma(x)<s]\\quad(\\sigma\\in2^{<\\omega}),\\\\\n\\Phi_{e,s}^{X}(x)\\simeq\\Phi_{e,s}^{\\operatorname{set}(X)}(x)\\quad(X\\in2^\\omega).\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"[s]","display":false},{"tex":"s","display":false},{"tex":"A_s","display":false}],"bytes":2350,"backlinks":[{"id":"2e0d85a730fd3a26","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation]]。"},{"id":"94da30522fe93e7f","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-function-tree]]；see [[20-df-e-splitting]]；see [[20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]。"},{"id":"476bf6706c15594f","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation]]；see [[20-df-low-high]]；see [[20-thm-shoenfield-limit]]；see [[20-thm-jump]]。"},{"id":"bb045b68eb24d902","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-computable-independence]]；see [[20-df-uniform-ce-sequence]]；see [[20-lem-one-action-priority-bound]]；see [[20-lem-use-preservation]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]；see [[20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation]]；see [[20-thm-smn]]。"},{"id":"d1590e1a5b9442b9","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation]]；see [[20-df-computable-approximation]]；see [[20-df-re]]。"},{"id":"0e3663ac78a646a4","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-re]]；see [[20-df-tred]]；see [[20-lem-one-action-priority-bound]]；see [[20-lem-use-preservation]]；see [[20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]。"},{"id":"76ff789378ca2b77","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-closed-class]]；see [[20-df-hyperimmune-free]]；see [[20-df-low-hi